UW Courses brings course descriptions, prerequisites, historical grades, and instructor information together in one place. This blog is a home for updates and notes about the site.

## Start exploring

- [Search courses](/search) to find a class by name or course code.
- [Browse departments](/departments) to explore a subject.
- [Explore prerequisite maps](/explorer) to see how courses connect.

Historical grades can provide context when comparing classes, but they do not measure workload or predict how a course will go for you. Read the course description and prerequisites alongside the numbers.

## Follow along

You can find the source code and contribute on [GitHub](https://github.com/twangodev/uwcourses).
